Cell["\<\
Trying to figure out static end points and wiggling in between:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.960282949118991*^9, 
  3.9602829578759937`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"776c1d01-5b7d-474b-a707-\
